<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston rates packaging firms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston rates packaging firms.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it started coverage of the packaging industry on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Ball Corp and Sonoco Products Co were started with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Crown Cork &amp; Seal Inc and Caraustar Industries Inc were started with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Ball shares lost 1/8 to 24-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Sonoco fell 1/8 to 26-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Crown rose 1/2 to 47-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Caraustar slid 1/4 to 28-3/4.</p>
</text>
